@base = http://localhost:8080

### live
GET {{base}}/health/live

### ready
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### 1. upload a blinker
# @name upload
POST {{base}}/api/v1/boards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "width": 3,
  "height": 3,
  "cells": [[false, false, false], [true, true, true], [false, false, false]]
}

### 2. next state
@id = replace-with-id
GET {{base}}/api/v1/boards/{{id}}/next

### 3. generation 4
GET {{base}}/api/v1/boards/{{id}}/generations/4

### 4. final state
GET {{base}}/api/v1/boards/{{id}}/final
